    <string name="clear_learned_confirm">Lumen will forget the words and phrases it has learned from your typing.</string>
    <string name="clear">Clear</string>
    <string name="privacy_note">Lumen only goes online for GIFs, sending just your GIF searches, language and region to the GIF service, and to check GitHub for its own updates. Voice typing hands what you say to your phone\'s speech service. Everything Lumen learns stays on this device unless you back it up, and it never learns from password or incognito fields.</string>

